  questionText:
  - language: English
    text: Which termini does a dipeptide have, and what charges do they carry at
      neutral pH?
  - language: German
    text: Welche Enden besitzt ein Dipeptid und welche Ladungen tragen sie bei neutralem
      pH?
  answers:
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Both ends are neutral
    - language: German
      text: Beide Enden sind neutral
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: "N-terminus: \u2013NH\u2083\u207A, C-terminus: \u2013COO\u207B"
    - language: German
      text: "N-Terminus: \u2013NH\u2083\u207A, C-Terminus: \u2013COO\u207B"
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: "N-terminus: \u2013COO\u207B, C-terminus: \u2013NH\u2083\u207A"
    - language: German
      text: "N-Terminus: \u2013COO\u207B, C-Terminus: \u2013NH\u2083\u207A"
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Both ends are negatively charged
    - language: German
      text: Beide Enden sind negativ geladen
  correctAnswer: 2
